<title>UK: SOCCER-NETHERLANDS BEAT WALES 2-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NETHERLANDS BEAT WALES 2-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Netherlands beat Wales 2-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a Euro under-21 group seven soccer qualifier</p>
<p>played on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Bruggink (52nd), Fuchs (83rd penalty)</p>
</text>
